Add support for ashmem-host for host Windows

Upstream: platform/system/core commit 7c4beee9, Michael Hoisie, 2024-01-12,
committed 2024-03-15. ashmem-host.cpp only; the commit's test and Android.bp
changes do not change what Linux builds.

Why: the region is a tmpfile() on host instead of a mkstemp() file under
/tmp. The commit is not in android-15.0.0_r1, but the official library
imports tmpfile and has no /tmp/android-ashmem string.

